  "transcription_notes": [
    "Table 13 reports absolute objective values, including the CEC function biases, rather than errors from the known optima.",
    "The source prints no experiment dimension; dimension is therefore null instead of being inferred from a CEC2017 convention or comparator paper.",
    "Table 13 includes f2 even though the final official CEC2017 suite removed that function for numerical instability. Its AO and RSA average/standard-deviation cells are printed as hyphens and are encoded as null, while both printed ranks are 8.",
    "The printed per-function ranks are preserved rather than regenerated from rounded averages. Ties are not assigned standard average ranks, and hidden precision may explain some orderings.",
    "The f28 RSA average is printed as 2300, below that function’s published 2800 bias; the apparent source inconsistency is preserved unchanged.",
    "The f14 AOBLMOA standard deviation is printed as 3346 alongside an average of 1442; both values are preserved unchanged."
  ],
  "reproduction_blockers": [
    "The article omits the CEC2017 experiment dimension, maximum function-evaluation budget, and seed schedule.",
